		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Albino humans cloaked in wings of orange flames. The offspring of fallen angels, seeking to regain divinity.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 42, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scimitar +6 (1d6) or 1 flame blast, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine Fire</strong>. Immune to fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flame Blast</strong>. Throw a fire blast within double near. All creatures in a near-sized cube around where the blast lands take 3d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flame Step</strong>. Step into an open flame and teleport to another flame within far.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
